---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Layout title="Mi Embarazo CYL - Tu embarazo, mas cerca">
  <Header />
  <main class="flex-1">
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/5 to-transparent">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pt-16 pb-20 sm:pt-24 sm:pb-28">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-primary/10 text-primary rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium mb-6">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 20l-5.447-2.724A1 1 0 013 16.382V5.618a1 1 0 011.447-.894L9 7m0 13l6-3m-6 3V7m6 10l4.553 2.276A1 1 0 0021 18.382V7.618a1 1 0 00-.553-.894L15 4m0 13V4m0 0L9 7" />
            </svg>
            Datos abiertos de Castilla y Leon
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-fg mb-6 leading-tight">
            Tu embarazo,<br /><span class="text-primary">mas cerca</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg text-muted max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10">
            Descubre los recursos sanitarios y territoriales que tienes cerca durante tu embarazo en Castilla y Leon.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3">
            <a href="/donde-vive" class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-primary hover:bg-primary-dark text-white font-medium px-6 py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors no-underline">
              Descubrir mi zona
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a href="#como-funciona" class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-transparent border-2 border-primary/30 text-primary hover:bg-primary/5 font-medium px-6 py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors no-underline">
              Como funciona
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="como-funciona" class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 sm:py-20">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-fg text-center mb-4">Como funciona</h2>
      <p class="text-muted text-center mb-12 max-w-lg mx-auto">En tres pasos sencillos descubres tu entorno sanitario.</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <span class="text-lg font-bold text-primary">01</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-fg mb-2">Donde vives</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">Selecciona tu municipio y la app identifica tu zona sanitaria automaticamente.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <span class="text-lg font-bold text-primary">02</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-fg mb-2">Conoce tu zona</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">Tu Zona Basica de Salud, centro de salud, consultorios y recursos cercanos.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <span class="text-lg font-bold text-primary">03</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-fg mb-2">Descubre tus recursos</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">Farmacias, hospitales, transporte y atencion urgente en tu territorio.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-t border-border bg-bg-subtle">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 sm:py-20">
        <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto text-center">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-fg mb-6">Sobre el proyecto</h2>
          <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Vivir un embarazo en una zona rural puede significar tener que desplazarse para acceder a determinados servicios.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
            <strong class="text-fg">Mi Embarazo CYL</strong> reune informacion publica para ayudarte a conocer mejor tu entorno sanitario durante el embarazo en Castilla y Leon.
          </p>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-secondary-light text-secondary rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-sm">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
            Informacion de datos abiertos. No sustituye el consejo medico.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 sm:py-20">
      <div class="text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-fg mb-4">Empieza ahora</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-8 max-w-md mx-auto">Introduce tu municipio y descubre todo lo que necesitas saber.</p>
        <a href="/donde-vive" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-primary hover:bg-primary-dark text-white font-medium px-8 py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors no-underline">
          Descubrir mi zona
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
